      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَافَتِ الجِيفَةُ</span></b> , aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَجِيفُ</span>; (K;) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جيّفت</span></b> ,
(S, * K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَجْيِيفٌ</span>; (S;) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اجتافت</span></b> ,
(K,) [and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تجيّفت</span></b> , Golius, as from the K, but
not found by me in any copy thereof,] and
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انجافت</span></b> ; (TA;) <i>The dead body stank,</i> or <i>became
stinking.</i> (S, * K, TA.)

